Sbrtlby Jotes was a [[Bestiary/Fiends|babau]], a kind of demon, who ran a drug ring out of a factory at 414 Anchor Street in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]] and hunted keystone 14 with hired henchmen, among them [[Bestiary/Fiends|pusks]] and [[Bestiary/Vermin|mioktans]]. His name matches no major culture on [[Færrin]]. He was about four feet tall, long and gangly, red and covered in mucus, and fought with a spear whose wounds would not close.

The Party killed him when the [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anouk Marchal|Marchal]] twins blew open his drug works, and the building came down after them.

His soul, being a demon's, was not destroyed: it is remaking itself in the demon [[Phenomena/Joker World|Joker world]], and he may find his way back. To end him for good, someone would have to go there.
